# mentorOS — Components Catalog

**Rule:** Before creating any new UI element, check this file. If a matching component exists, **use it**. Extend via props — **never duplicate**.

Custom primitives live in `src/components/ui/` (NOT shadcn/Radix).

---

## PMP shared components (`src/components/pmp/shared/`)

### TimerBar

**Path:** `src/components/pmp/shared/TimerBar.tsx`

```typescript
interface TimerBarProps {
  benchmark: number
  isActive: boolean
  onTick?: (seconds: number) => void
}
```

| Use | Don't use |
|-----|-----------|
| PMP timed answer/decode flows | Static progress unrelated to time |
| Mood 1 benchmark 77s, Mood 2 benchmark 25s | Countdown with different color logic duplicated inline |

Color states: green → amber → orange → red based on elapsed vs benchmark.

---

### ImageUpload

**Path:** `src/components/pmp/shared/ImageUpload.tsx`

```typescript
interface ImageUploadProps {
  onExtracted: (text: string) => void
  onError: (message: string) => void
  isLoading: boolean
  setIsLoading: (loading: boolean) => void
}
```

| Use | Don't use |
|-----|-----------|
| Standalone OCR dropzone flows | New file input + fetch to `/api/pmp/ocr` |

**Note:** `InputScreen.tsx` implements **inline** upload (paste, attach, OCR) — preferred for unified input box. Use `ImageUpload` only if building a separate upload screen.

