## UI primitives (`src/components/ui/`)

### Button

**Path:** `src/components/ui/Button.tsx`

```typescript
interface ButtonProps {
  variant?: 'primary' | 'ghost' | 'product'
  size?: 'default' | 'sm'
  gradient?: string
  href?: string
  external?: boolean
  disabled?: boolean
  className?: string
  children: React.ReactNode
  onClick?: () => void
}
```

| Variant | Use |
|---------|-----|
| `primary` | Shell CTAs — obsidian bg |
| `ghost` | Secondary actions, sidebar-adjacent |
| `product` | Inside product modules — pass `gradient="bg-gradient-pmp"` |

Min touch: `min-h-touch min-w-touch` built in.

---

