## CollapsibleSection (local pattern)

Not exported — copy pattern from `LessonScreen.tsx` when building similar lesson outputs. See `mentoros-design.mdc`.

---

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ New timer bar component — use `TimerBar`
- ❌ New EN/VI pill — use `LangToggle`
- ❌ Radix/shadcn Tooltip — use `GlossaryTooltip` or native `title` on collapsed sidebar items
- ❌ Duplicate `Button` styles inline — use `Button` or documented header button class constants
